    "id": "cell_certificate_v2_hd",
    "scope": "Step 2, coded-print native-wide-field development only. Freeze the v2 reader after the oblique synthetic and narrow development replay. Not a vision-controlled run. No confirmation, M5 acceptance, M6 or M7. One explicitly identified legacy printed specimen to permit the same physical checkpoints; no new coupon or motion setting.",
    "fixture": "Replay the archived measured-rest planar-rim non-anatomical sheet, actual staged controller SHA256 4af2af2da33785b5110a6d0201a3403ef5496dc14d0625fdf706fa81b3435cf5. Keep the entire old mechanical config, camera target and ray visibility. Use ONLY its passive setCellCertificatePrint overlay while physics is frozen and restore the original render. Require byte-identical original native RGB-D, identical nodes, edges, faces, measured cutter TCP and bite/event checkpoint before branching. Verify post-exposure sensor/time/physical identity. No resizing, no geometry or filenames in the reader.",
    "acquisition": "True 70-degree HFOV, 1280x960. One loaded/pull-only zero control; for actual 3/6/8/9/10 mm, collect a working and one guarded closed 3-mm back-off exposure at each independent replay of a registered reference checkpoint. Use first, second and third closures of seam_rim_near_v1/asym/near for 3/6/8; third closures of seam_rim_zoom_v1/asym/b and c for 9/10. Use original seam_rim_zoom_v1/asym/pull for zero. Branch once per replay so extra back-offs never alter later work states. Check unchanged topology and cut events, maintained grasps, tension, jaw closure, no tear/fault, back-off residual <=0.5mm, non-park clearance >0.5mm; require real guarded closed return to ready after collecting the look, do not label an early 3mm probe as a task DONE.",
    "gate": "Seal RGB-D-only v2 and rigid three-marker predictions before independent structural joins. Per raw frame also use 0.5mm Gaussian depth noise, seeded from the complete raw depth bytes. Require no incorrect face/local/prefix, no projected corner enclosure misses, no numeric estimate on zero or shutter, correct actual structural length and fresh tool pose simultaneously on at least one of work/look in BOTH variants for EVERY 3/6/8/9/10 checkpoint. Require at least one nonempty positive coded-cell observation; measure decoded cap/face ink coverage as separate diagnostics. Scores from 20 degrees, other prints, parked images or simulator vertices cannot satisfy this gate. Report prefix separately: a local ordinal without continuity proof cannot authorize a bite/withdrawal."
